    {
      "id": "M4143-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A: 虚构工业观测：温度在0,1,2,3,4秒采集，浓度在0.5,2.5,4.5秒采集。两个传感器各自周期固定，但时间点不重合。作者说“multirate只能是同步固定时钟；不同步必然就是irregular sampling，两个概念互斥”，并把每秒表格中前向保持的浓度值都计为新采样。请检查这几条说法，并给不超过45词的英文原始采集/对齐描述。不得改真实采样次数，不强造新机制名。若不同领域对asynchronous有不同定义，明确本题指时间戳不对齐，不泛化到通信协议。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Retain fixed per-stream periods with noncoincident timestamps and the scoped asynchronous meaning.",
        "Preserve five/three native acquisitions and forward-hold availability."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Require universal synchronization or equate all timestamp mismatch with irregular intervals.",
        "Count held grid values as new observations or use a future reading early."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves regular per-stream periods with noncoincident timestamps, scoped asynchronous meaning, native counts and forward-hold availability.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4143-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4143-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4143-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B: 另一虚构变量在0,0.8,2.6,3.0秒观测。作者将平均间隔的倒数称为平均采样频率，并据此认为序列已经均匀；还把序列位置embedding称为实际时间间隔，并宣称某个latent alignment模块补全了所有缺失测量，实际该模块只匹配两个编码器的潜在分布，没有输出测量值。请区分这些信息和作用，写不超过45词的正向英文方法说明；不新增插值或时间模块，不因均值不存在就否定所有平均频率统计。审查意见放英文正文外。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Preserve a declared average-frequency statistic without making the sequence uniform.",
        "Keep sequence position, elapsed time and latent-distribution alignment distinct."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Ban all average-frequency statistics.",
        "Invent measurement completion or a new timing module."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Correctly distinguishes average-frequency summaries, irregular intervals, sequence position and latent alignment without inventing completed measurements.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4143-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4143-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_fresh_context_three_identical_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4143-C",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "C: 虚构软测量研究：反应温度每秒采集，组分每4秒采集，两路各自规则；质量目标对应当前过程时刻且实际在该时刻评分。作者已确认所有预测输入均在对应评分时刻已获得。分别编码两路原生观测，利用两路已有观测时间间隔作为模型输入；核心设计按其真实时间间隔对潜在特征进行加权并在共同质量预测时刻融合，预测当前产品质量。无缺失值重建输出，无改变实际采样计划或自动学习参数的在线更新。固定模拟基准与生产数据比较表明整体质量预测误差低于共同慢采样时间下丢弃快路中间观测的比较法，但最大组分观测间隔下误差仍增加。请写150-180词完整英文摘要与不超过45词的一项贡献候选，连清工业采集事实、真实建模要求、时间条件加权、融合及最终质量输出。区分下采样造成的信息丢弃与已真实恢复所有信息；保留误差权衡，不新增显著性、部署、因果识别、测量补全、采样计划改变或算法新专名。新颖性须另核，不把普通实验本身充贡献。篇幅限制仅适用于本题。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Connect native measurements, interval-based weighting, fusion and current quality prediction.",
        "Retain the overall error benefit, sparse-composition cost and one actual design contribution candidate."
      ],
